                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "We used secondary data from the LISS panel to perform this study. The LISS panel aims to enable social science research with data from a representative sample of the Dutch population. We used a subset of the LISS panel data to assess the association between five economic variables (income, income fluctuations, savings, debts, and employment) and the subjective experience of financial stress."
                },
